  "prefLabel": "Crv 104.01 Office Location and Mailing Address, Telephone Number, and Number for TTY/TDD Users",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Crv 104.01 Office Location and Mailing Address, Telephone Number, and Number for TTY/TDD Users.\n\n(a) The office location and mailing address for the commission is:\n\nConnecticut River Valley Resource Commission\n\nMain Street\n\nP.O. Box 1182\n\nCharlestown, New Hampshire 03603\n\n(b) The telephone number for the commission is (603) 826-4800.\n\n(c) TTY/TDD users may reach the commission through Relay New Hampshire by calling 711.\n\nSource. #7567, eff 9-28-01",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/crv100.html"
